---
description: >-
  Verifies that edges can be annotated with @{ animation: slow|fast } metadata
  to render animated dashed-line edges, alongside independent node styling via
  style directives.
---

      flowchart TD
          A(["Start"]) L_A_B_0@--> B{"Decision"}
          B --> C["Option A"] & D["Option B"]
          style C stroke-width:4px,stroke-dasharray: 5
          L_A_B_0@{ animation: slow }
          L_B_D_0@{ animation: fast }
